// Darke County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-09
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Sites that block automated fetching (the Auditor/Treasurer
// site, the City of Greenville, the Coalition for a Healthy Darke County) were
// checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * greenvillepubliclibrary.org is the Greenville Public Library in Greenville,
//     ILLINOIS. The Darke County library is greenville-publiclibrary.org (with a
//     hyphen), 520 Sycamore St.
//   * empowerdarkecounty.com is not the Darke County ESC; it is Empowering Darke
//     County Youth, a Greenville tutoring nonprofit, and is listed under that name.
//     The ESC has no site of its own.
//   * The City of Greenville moved to cityofgreenvilleohio.gov (CivicEngage);
//     cityofgreenville.org redirects there.
//   * The Auditor and Treasurer share one Pivot Point site, darkecountyrealestate.org.
//   * mainstreetgreenville.org redirects to experiencemainstreet.com.
//   * Bear's Mill has been part of the Darke County Park District since 2021.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Greenville IL/NC/SC/MI/AL; Versailles KY; Union City IN (unioncity-in.com);
//   madisonvillage.org is Madison Village in Lake County, not New Madison;
//   hsdayton.org/greenville is a Dayton Humane Society SEO page.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Greenville, the county seat), 20 villages and 20 townships.
//     Bradford straddles Darke and Miami; Burkettsville straddles Darke and Mercer.
//   * The Clerk of Courts has no site of her own; the county links the office to
//     the Municipal Court site (darkecourts.com).
//   * Mental health and recovery is the Tri-County Board (Troy), shared with Miami
//     and Shelby. Miami Valley CTC (Englewood) runs satellite programs in four
//     Darke districts. Edison State's Greenville campus is a branch of the Piqua
//     college.
//   * Greenville Transit System is run by the city and serves all of Darke County.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * Village of Arcanum (villageofarcanum.com): the home page footer carries
//     gambling/slot spam links, so the site appears compromised.
//   * County News Online: no publisher or address named. Darke Journal: dormant
//     since 2019.
//   * No own websites found for the Engineer, Prosecutor, Coroner, Recorder (vendor
//     search only), Airport, ESC, Humane Society, Habitat/Fuller Center, Steam
//     Threshers or the historical societies.
//   * WTGR and WTKD radio: licensed in the county but no station websites.

